      </ul>
      <p>Service availability, features, and functionality may change over time. Specific service descriptions and pricing are provided at sign-up or in service-specific agreements.</p>

      <hr>

      <h2>4. SMS Communications</h2>
      <p>This section describes the terms governing SMS messages sent through our services. By opting in to SMS notifications, you agree to the following:</p>

      <p><strong>Consent:</strong> You expressly consent to receive SMS notifications from Probuild Digital LLC at the mobile number you provide. Consent is not a condition of purchase. SMS notifications are opt-in only and are disabled by default.</p>

      <p><strong>Use case:</strong> SMS messages are transactional notifications about activity at your property, including but not limited to new booking inquiries, intent upgrades on existing leads, and current-guest signups. We do not send marketing or promotional content under this program.</p>

