      <p>We may suspend or terminate your access for violation of these terms or for any other reason at our discretion.</p>

      <hr>

      <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>Probuild Digital and its licensors retain all rights, title, and interest in and to the services, including all software, content, designs, and trademarks. Subject to your compliance with these Terms, we grant you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use our services for their intended purpose.</p>
      <p>You retain ownership of content you provide to us (such as property information, house rules, and other inputs). You grant us a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license to use that content as necessary to operate the services for you.</p>

