      <p>We may suspend or terminate your access immediately if you breach these Terms, engage in fraudulent or harmful conduct, or for other reasons at our discretion. Upon termination, your right to use the services ends, but Sections that by their nature should survive termination (including intellectual property, limitation of liability, and dispute resolution) will continue to apply.</p>

